 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Di9bDQ6pdPIQ7kNvwEY5L-c&_nc_oc=AdpuP4Y63apZYIibOAfMzsLI8McCRdtGTPk5WMhcf3aiuGtXL-1o4pQn1OhYLJo66JE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMEpkggiRdTAWcg1fNOyPzR7RTK2G7ftdNYrM9eIgTH8Q&oe=6ACF9D41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dBrYa7sgOYQ7kNvwFK7KaE&_nc_oc=AdqL2-Dyar4fewy9YCEpvD1x0Ancnmz3hkzhEmY4Isf-HJPkCa7SupHRk5fng_kJdUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPuctj-Ye80IbTVIXeed7AJgqfuq79YmbcBQJW77MfsXw&oe=6ACFAAA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7pdp3CEFfIwQ7kNvwHIQe6_&_nc_oc=AdooX2sYay6IbylPoRu2Pw5Xa44mKf0x6LUGfXfrbor68JiS9zn_kqDvYvE2HVhJAuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQODL9maunQNxtB5BH1cfsry9gulSkHTCj7unPa3kPfSoQ&oe=6ACFB49C"}, {"fil